## Reproducibility

The repository provides the computational materials required to reproduce the main data transformation and deep learning experiments reported in the study.

To reproduce the computational workflow:

1. Install the required Python dependencies.
2. Access the processed dataset included in the repository.
3. Run `Feature to image conversion.py` to generate the image-based feature representations.
4. Run `Cnn classification pipeline.py` to perform CNN-based classification.
5. Evaluate the generated model outputs using the evaluation procedures described in the study.

Additional preprocessing scripts, model configurations, evaluation procedures, and supporting materials may be added to the repository as the reproducibility package is further developed.

